Subject: Implement native MEM2 arenas and release/reset OS memory at shutdown

Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Wire the existing mem2Size configuration to real owned host memory, expose Wii arena calls,
reject invalid/overflowing arena allocations, and reset arenas/heaps/OS initialization before
freeing memory. MEM1 debug reservations on Windows are retained for correct release.
Native addresses are never forced into console address ranges. This does not implement
MEM2 physical/cached/uncached address translation or IOS/Wii memory-map parity.

